CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION as_getallegationsandindicaors(p_intakeservicereqtypeid uuid)
 RETURNS TABLE(allegationname character varying, allegationid uuid, indicatorid uuid, allegationindicatorname character varying, datype character varying)
 LANGUAGE plpgsql
AS $function$    
BEGIN    

RETURN QUERY
select a.name as allegagtionname, a.allegationid, i.indicatorid, i.indicatorname as allegationindicatorname, isrt.intakeservreqtypekey as datype from allegation a 
JOin indicator i on i.allegationid=a.allegationid and i.activeflag=1
Join intakeservicerequesttype isrt on isrt.intakeservreqtypeid= a.intakeservicereqtypeid and isrt.activeflag=1
where a.activeflag=1 and  isrt.intakeservreqtypeid=p_intakeservicereqtypeid 
order by a.name, i.indicatorname;
          
END;
$function$

